---
import InteriorHero from '../components/redesign/InteriorHero.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/RedesignLayout.astro';
import ContactBand from '../components/redesign/ContactBand.astro';
---
<Layout title="Our Shop" active="our-shop"><InteriorHero image="/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMG_1059-scaled-e1681152170569.jpeg" alt="The mission, vision and values on the wall at My Mechanic" label="HONESTY. INTEGRITY. TRANSPARENCY."><p class="eyebrow">LOCAL ROOTS. REAL PEOPLE.</p><h1>Your mechanic. <br/><em>Your neighbor.</em></h1><p>A repair shop you can feel good coming back to. My Mechanic Maintenance & Repair serves Tucson from our shop on North Romero Road.</p></InteriorHero><section class="section container detail-layout"><div><h2>Good service starts <br/>with listening.</h2><p>We work with each customer on an individual basis to help decide which route of repair will work best for them.</p><p>We aim to earn your trust and have a long term relationship with you.</p><a class="text-link" href="/#reviews">Read our customer reviews </a></div><div class="shop-values"><article><h3>Know what comes next.</h3><p>We offer fair and transparent pricing and provide estimates upfront for hundreds of services on thousands of cars.</p></article><article><h3>Convenient ways to get here.</h3><p>We offer loaner cars, free shuttle services, and after hours pick up and drop off.</p></article><article><h3>Feel confident on the road.</h3><p>Yes, we offer a 36 month or 36000 mile nationwide warranty through Technet.</p></article></div></section><section class="shop-culture section container"><div><p class="eyebrow">MORE THAN WORDS ON A WALL</p><h2>The little things <br/><em>matter here.</em></h2><p>We stay that way with our commitment to our customers, our staff, and vendors by adhering to 3 main principles. HONESTY, INTEGRITY and TRANSPARENCY.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Meet your neighborhood shop</a></div><div class="shop-history"><article><strong>2008</strong><div><h3>Started with customer service.</h3><p>My Mechanic began as a part-time business with a focus on bringing personal service back to auto repair.</p></div></article><article><strong>2012</strong><div><h3>Opened to the public.</h3><p>In 2012 my mechanic opened to the public, becoming the customer service driven shop you see today.</p></div></article><p>Honesty, integrity and transparency have guided the shop from the beginning.</p></div></section><ContactBand/></Layout>
